WEBVTT

00:02.085 --> 00:03.086
TENGOKU-DAIMAKYO

00:03.169 --> 00:05.588
How far is it to Ibaraki and Nara?

00:05.672 --> 00:06.965
Far enough.

00:07.048 --> 00:09.926
But Ibaraki is closer than Nara.

00:10.010 --> 00:12.679
THE WALLED TOWN

00:13.555 --> 00:17.142
Nara, Bakinara, Bakinara, Ibaraki.

00:17.225 --> 00:19.227
Nara, Ibaraki, Nara, Ibaraki.

00:19.310 --> 00:20.603
Nara, Baraki, Baraki.

00:20.687 --> 00:22.480
Nara, Kibara, Nara, Ibaraki, Nara--

00:22.564 --> 00:24.858
Shut up with the "narabaki, narabaki!"

00:24.941 --> 00:28.570
But five hours is so long.

00:28.653 --> 00:30.613
What are you? A kid?

00:30.697 --> 00:32.699
Can't we get there faster?

00:33.241 --> 00:37.245
Well, it might take
longer than five hours.

00:37.328 --> 00:38.663
-What?
-What?

00:38.747 --> 00:41.291
Well, the earthquake made the roads…

00:41.374 --> 00:43.877
Then, how long is it gonna take?

00:43.960 --> 00:45.170
I'm not sure.

00:45.837 --> 00:47.088
That's weird.

00:47.797 --> 00:51.760
You're not taking us to your friends
to get back at us, are you?

00:51.843 --> 00:53.762
I'd never do that.

00:54.346 --> 00:55.930
Didn't you mean what you said earlier?

00:56.014 --> 00:57.015
ABOUT TWO HOURS AGO

00:57.098 --> 00:59.225
You scared me!

00:59.309 --> 01:00.643
What do you mean?

01:00.727 --> 01:04.022
You said you wanted to see
if the baby is still alive.

01:05.982 --> 01:07.859
The story about the breeding pig is true.

01:08.360 --> 01:11.529
I was going to take revenge
once I got everything ready.

01:11.613 --> 01:13.907
Is that why you wanted my gun?

01:14.407 --> 01:17.243
Sis, this tattoo is the real thing.

01:24.501 --> 01:27.045
<i>Let me ask you one thing. Where is it?</i>

01:27.128 --> 01:30.298
On roads that are
in good condition, about five hours.

01:30.799 --> 01:32.050
It's around here.

01:32.634 --> 01:34.302
<i>Isn't it practically in Ibaraki?</i>

01:34.386 --> 01:37.555
<i>Isn't that what you call "perfect pitch"?</i>

01:39.641 --> 01:40.642
<i>It's "timing."</i>

02:05.041 --> 02:06.042
I didn't steal it.

02:09.587 --> 02:11.881
I-- I'm sorry.

02:11.965 --> 02:13.008
Are you okay?

02:14.801 --> 02:19.848
But does this mean you'll trust me now?

02:23.935 --> 02:24.936
Juichi.

02:26.187 --> 02:28.440
I'm still only coming with you
to see if the baby's alive.

02:33.194 --> 02:34.821
That's good enough.

02:41.911 --> 02:44.873
Let's hide the car here and go. Then--

02:44.956 --> 02:46.916
Hey, don't stand out so much!

02:49.836 --> 02:51.254
Miss, wait a minute!

02:51.338 --> 02:53.590
There's something I need to check.

02:59.596 --> 03:00.847
You jerk!

03:00.930 --> 03:04.726
Don't feel up the chest
of another man's woman!

03:04.809 --> 03:06.436
I-- I'm sorry!

03:06.936 --> 03:08.730
Who is whose woman?

03:08.813 --> 03:10.565
I-- I'm sorry.

03:10.648 --> 03:13.860
That's not it. I didn't notice yesterday,

03:13.943 --> 03:17.197
but your large chest
could put you in danger.

03:17.280 --> 03:18.281
Why?

03:20.992 --> 03:24.245
Women with big chests
are hated in that town.

03:24.329 --> 03:26.456
Please keep your jacket zipped up.

03:26.539 --> 03:28.833
Some had to cut theirs off to live there.

03:28.917 --> 03:29.918
SELF-IMPOSED RESTRAINT

03:30.001 --> 03:32.545
Why would women do that to each other?

03:32.629 --> 03:36.299
They're a crazy bunch that imprisoned
a young boy and tattooed him!

03:36.383 --> 03:39.052
Who knows what they're thinking?

03:39.135 --> 03:42.013
Now I'm worried. I'm going with you!

03:42.097 --> 03:44.933
You idiot! It's even more dangerous
to go with a man!

03:45.016 --> 03:48.228
If you want to go,
I've got something good.

03:49.521 --> 03:52.315
-Maybe a little to the left?
-Oh, you're right.

03:56.945 --> 03:58.238
How does it look?

04:01.282 --> 04:04.077
W-- What the… You're p-- pretty.

04:04.160 --> 04:05.995
Why don't you look happy?

04:07.664 --> 04:08.832
Hey, Juichi!

04:08.915 --> 04:10.333
Who's prettier?

04:10.417 --> 04:13.795
What? Naturally, you, miss.

04:13.878 --> 04:15.672
S-- Since you're a woman.

04:16.172 --> 04:19.217
Okay! Should we go now?

04:19.300 --> 04:20.427
What's with her?

04:20.927 --> 04:22.220
This is, you know--

04:22.303 --> 04:23.304
Shut up.

04:25.724 --> 04:27.350
It's this way.

04:33.440 --> 04:36.109
You'll see the school building
right in front.

04:36.693 --> 04:39.696
You know, if we can see it from here,
then they can see--

04:39.779 --> 04:41.448
I got it. I got it.

04:42.490 --> 04:43.616
We'll be back.

04:44.117 --> 04:45.910
Don't mess with our stuff!

04:46.411 --> 04:48.788
I won't touch it.

04:50.415 --> 04:53.418
There are people who would, though.

04:53.918 --> 04:55.879
That girl, right? The King of Hotels?

04:56.838 --> 04:58.173
I wonder how she's doing.

04:58.673 --> 05:00.508
I hope she's good.

05:03.136 --> 05:06.598
That's one giant hole
for a place called the Walled Town.

05:07.265 --> 05:08.975
Right, coming in.

05:09.059 --> 05:10.769
Wait for me, Sis.

05:15.857 --> 05:19.652
It's not just abandoned, it's wrecked.

05:21.321 --> 05:23.823
It's already…

05:23.907 --> 05:25.116
Yeah.

05:25.200 --> 05:27.494
It looks like people already lived here.

05:28.244 --> 05:31.748
Since it's such a mess,
they must have moved out, right?

05:32.332 --> 05:34.000
Then what about the breeding pigs?

05:35.585 --> 05:37.087
Let's look around some more.

05:38.838 --> 05:41.341
Is anyone here?

05:47.389 --> 05:49.974
You never watch where you're going.

05:50.058 --> 05:53.019
I was trying to be careful.

05:54.521 --> 05:55.855
This sleeping bag is nice.

05:58.191 --> 06:02.320
Isn't it like they just disappeared?
Leaving their things like this?

06:03.738 --> 06:04.739
So that's it.

06:05.323 --> 06:07.158
Maru, this journal is incomplete.

06:07.826 --> 06:08.910
Incomplete?

06:08.993 --> 06:11.287
The journal stops with only a date
on this page.

06:11.871 --> 06:12.872
This…

06:15.500 --> 06:16.543
What the--

06:16.626 --> 06:17.877
It got so cold…

06:22.924 --> 06:25.051
Ouch. What was that for--

06:27.303 --> 06:28.304
Sis?

06:31.641 --> 06:33.518
Sis! The water!

06:33.601 --> 06:34.686
The room!

06:35.937 --> 06:37.022
Damn.

06:37.105 --> 06:38.440
Maru.

06:38.523 --> 06:39.858
It's a Man-eater.

06:40.942 --> 06:42.193
It's gotta be close.

06:42.277 --> 06:43.278
Find it.

06:46.698 --> 06:47.782
My eyes

06:47.866 --> 06:49.117
are sticking shut.

06:57.459 --> 06:59.085
Above us! Sis!

07:09.846 --> 07:11.639
So it was a Hiruko.

07:14.184 --> 07:15.352
Damn it.

07:15.435 --> 07:17.020
That was really bad.

07:17.103 --> 07:19.564
A second longer and it would've killed us.

07:21.399 --> 07:22.984
How did you know it was up there?

07:23.485 --> 07:24.486
Just somehow.

07:24.569 --> 07:25.862
Somehow?

07:30.658 --> 07:31.659
Let's run for it.

07:34.037 --> 07:35.413
It's following us from above!

07:35.497 --> 07:37.332
Better not bump into it on the stairs!

07:40.627 --> 07:43.004
What are you doing? Come on!

07:44.881 --> 07:45.924
Sis?

07:46.883 --> 07:48.677
Weren't we running away?

08:16.204 --> 08:17.497
<i>It's doing it.</i>

08:37.892 --> 08:38.893
<i>I get it now.</i>

08:39.644 --> 08:41.271
<i>Just as I thought.</i>

08:42.272 --> 08:43.982
<i>It's that kind of attack.</i>

08:44.816 --> 08:47.193
<i>No need to be scared now. I understand it.</i>

08:48.028 --> 08:51.573
<i>You get the upper hand when you</i>
<i>surprise and freeze them in a small space,</i>

08:52.365 --> 08:55.410
<i>but when someone runs at you</i>
<i>with a weapon before they freeze,</i>

08:55.493 --> 08:56.578
<i>you're in trouble!</i>

09:08.506 --> 09:09.507
It's not here.

09:09.591 --> 09:13.303
I can get in, but I can't find the core.

09:13.386 --> 09:16.389
Half of it ran away.
So that was its main body.

09:17.140 --> 09:18.141
What should we do?

09:22.812 --> 09:23.813
You're leaving?

09:24.731 --> 09:25.815
Hey, Sis.

09:26.358 --> 09:29.652
This town is completely gone, Maru.

09:30.779 --> 09:34.449
We were only asked to confirm his safety.

09:51.007 --> 09:53.259
Like I can say it.

09:53.343 --> 09:55.345
Then I'll tell him.

09:55.887 --> 09:57.013
That's fine, right?

09:58.390 --> 10:00.266
There was no one there?

10:00.767 --> 10:01.810
No women either?

10:02.310 --> 10:03.853
And there was a Hiruko.

10:03.937 --> 10:05.605
A Man-eater was living there.

10:07.607 --> 10:09.067
So aside from the child,

10:10.026 --> 10:12.696
even those I hated weren't there.

10:15.407 --> 10:17.367
A Man-eater turned it into a nest.

10:17.450 --> 10:19.077
So it just means no one is living there.

10:19.911 --> 10:22.580
The Man-eater could have
started living there

10:22.664 --> 10:25.250
after everyone moved,
when the building got too old.

10:27.711 --> 10:31.423
Juichi, you can't lose hope.

10:35.301 --> 10:37.929
Hey! You three slant eyes!

10:38.972 --> 10:42.017
Who's calling us weird names?

10:42.100 --> 10:44.394
-Is it him?
-Yeah, I'm sure.

10:44.477 --> 10:45.979
It can't be--

10:46.062 --> 10:47.147
Look, see!

10:47.731 --> 10:49.482
Aren't you Boar #11?

10:49.566 --> 10:50.859
You're alive!

10:53.153 --> 10:55.572
Boar #6! And Boar #9!

10:55.655 --> 10:57.365
Don't call us that!

10:57.449 --> 11:00.660
You're the one who said it first!
I just copied you!

11:00.744 --> 11:03.913
So, we're living somewhere else now.

11:03.997 --> 11:06.750
The kid born from your seed is healthy!

11:06.833 --> 11:10.462
-What?
-Anyways, come see!

11:11.046 --> 11:12.589
…and that's what happened.

11:14.382 --> 11:16.843
Was it about a month?

11:17.344 --> 11:19.220
It was a month after you ran away,

11:19.304 --> 11:21.431
and those two women had been executed.

11:22.098 --> 11:24.225
Your son started crying
in the middle of the night.

11:25.393 --> 11:28.229
<i>Who knows what those women</i>
<i>would do if it annoyed them?</i>

11:28.772 --> 11:29.981
<i>So we all tried to quiet him.</i>

11:31.274 --> 11:32.317
<i>That's when</i>

11:33.485 --> 11:35.445
<i>the monster invaded.</i>

11:36.321 --> 11:38.740
Because we were awake,

11:38.823 --> 11:41.910
we were able to escape
through the hole the monster created.

11:44.579 --> 11:47.791
Look, Jugo! It's your dad!

11:47.874 --> 11:50.251
Not me. That way, Jugo.

11:52.337 --> 11:54.130
I said it's not me.

11:54.214 --> 11:55.715
He won't understand.

12:12.732 --> 12:14.025
Good for him.

12:14.109 --> 12:16.653
His enemies are all dead
and his kid is okay.

12:16.736 --> 12:18.113
Isn't it great?

12:18.196 --> 12:21.116
Now I won't feel bad taking his money.

12:22.492 --> 12:24.953
Why are you lying like that,

12:25.453 --> 12:26.830
when you're clearly crying?

12:26.913 --> 12:27.997
Shut up.

12:32.127 --> 12:33.712
Hey, what else do we have?

12:33.795 --> 12:37.632
Boar meat, deer, mouse and a small bird.

12:37.716 --> 12:39.217
Let's just cook it all!

12:39.300 --> 12:40.969
Is it a big mouse? Small?

12:41.052 --> 12:42.679
-The small kind.
-Did you kill it?

12:42.762 --> 12:44.931
-No way!
-Can I have a drink?

12:45.015 --> 12:47.851
-I want to cook that smoked meat I made.
-That sounds good.

12:47.934 --> 12:50.103
-It was so tasty.
-Alcohol is--

12:50.186 --> 12:51.187
Juichi.

12:52.397 --> 12:54.816
Eat. It's your welcome party.

12:58.653 --> 13:00.697
I want to thank you for Jugo.

13:00.780 --> 13:03.491
They said you were taking care of him.

13:03.992 --> 13:06.244
Of course. He's your son.

13:08.663 --> 13:10.040
You know, Juichi--

13:13.793 --> 13:17.213
So stupid. Stu-- stupid.

13:21.301 --> 13:24.387
After freezing today,
thank goodness for this.

13:36.107 --> 13:39.736
I'm so sleepy after that hot bath
and eating my fill of meat.

13:39.819 --> 13:41.488
What are we doing tomorrow?

13:41.571 --> 13:44.616
Let's go find that Ibaraki facility.

13:44.699 --> 13:46.159
How are we gonna find it?

13:46.242 --> 13:48.370
I've got an idea…

13:50.914 --> 13:53.041
She fell asleep while talking.

13:57.420 --> 13:58.713
Lights out.

14:20.026 --> 14:21.903
Wake up, Maru!

14:22.946 --> 14:24.406
Sis, this is…

14:24.489 --> 14:25.865
There's no mistaking it.

14:26.449 --> 14:27.617
Everyone get outside!

14:27.701 --> 14:30.537
This cold is an attack by a Man-eater!

14:32.330 --> 14:33.456
Where's Juichi?

14:33.540 --> 14:34.541
He's not here?

14:35.417 --> 14:36.418
Juichi isn't here!

14:36.501 --> 14:38.378
Calm down! You sure?

14:38.962 --> 14:41.256
The leader and Jugo aren't here either!

14:41.756 --> 14:45.802
Damn it! Where are you, Juichi?
Get outside now!

14:47.387 --> 14:48.471
Juichi.

14:49.055 --> 14:50.348
He's just unconscious.

14:50.432 --> 14:52.017
Here, take Jugo.

14:54.227 --> 14:56.438
Everyone! Get on the road and run around!

14:56.521 --> 14:59.566
If you don't keep moving,
you'll die in a minute!

15:02.652 --> 15:03.653
<i>Stay calm.</i>

15:04.362 --> 15:06.614
<i>My head's so cold, it hurts!</i>

15:06.698 --> 15:08.116
<i>I can still feel my legs.</i>

15:12.078 --> 15:13.204
<i>Something's wrong.</i>

15:13.705 --> 15:16.750
<i>I can't get away from the cold</i>
<i>no matter how much I run.</i>

15:17.584 --> 15:19.377
<i>My lungs are freezing.</i>

15:20.253 --> 15:21.838
<i>Is it chasing me?</i>

15:22.547 --> 15:24.674
<i>Then why can't I see it?</i>

15:25.300 --> 15:26.676
<i>Or hear its footsteps?</i>

15:27.594 --> 15:28.970
<i>Damn it!</i>

15:29.554 --> 15:32.515
<i>The attack range I figured out earlier…</i>

15:33.016 --> 15:35.935
<i>Did I get it wrong?</i>

15:42.150 --> 15:43.151
Sis!

15:49.074 --> 15:51.785
<i>The cold air is gone.</i>

15:55.872 --> 15:57.665
You're good now! Sis!

15:59.042 --> 16:01.378
-Don't go near him!
-Let me go!

16:01.461 --> 16:04.172
The baby's gonna die!
Are you gonna let him die?

16:04.255 --> 16:06.591
No! That kid's the Hiruko!

16:08.176 --> 16:10.470
I know now since I've fought
them a few times.

16:10.553 --> 16:14.224
I can sense a Hiruko's presence.

16:15.475 --> 16:19.270
Sis. That kid is the one
doing this cold attack.

16:49.551 --> 16:51.344
The cold is gone now.

16:51.428 --> 16:53.096
Like nothing happened.

16:57.726 --> 16:58.768
Okay, it's okay.

17:00.895 --> 17:06.443
They said they can remove
the thing inside me soon.

17:08.069 --> 17:09.904
After that I can go back…

17:11.656 --> 17:12.657
…to school.

17:13.283 --> 17:16.411
And I can see you, Kona.

17:20.915 --> 17:23.668
I want to see you soon, Kona.

17:35.305 --> 17:36.639
<i>It'll be born soon.</i>

17:39.017 --> 17:41.561
Dr. Sawatari!

17:43.480 --> 17:44.522
It'll be fine.

17:46.524 --> 17:47.901
Jugo!

17:47.984 --> 17:49.444
And this too.

17:50.653 --> 17:54.407
It expired ten years ago,
but it's better than nothing.

17:55.033 --> 17:56.034
Thanks.

17:57.452 --> 17:59.496
Is it really okay to take it?

17:59.579 --> 18:01.873
We have more of the same medicine.

18:02.791 --> 18:04.250
Not that.

18:04.834 --> 18:06.127
The car.

18:09.297 --> 18:12.509
I don't have a reason to travel anymore.

18:13.218 --> 18:18.306
Besides, the car here
is much better than mine.

18:21.226 --> 18:23.687
Yeah. You're right.

18:27.774 --> 18:28.983
See ya, Juichi.

18:29.484 --> 18:32.654
Careful you don't get frozen to death
by your son!

18:47.585 --> 18:50.255
What? Crap. That's weird.

18:51.464 --> 18:53.758
-Sis?
-I know!

18:53.842 --> 18:55.343
Let's go. Come on!

18:57.637 --> 18:58.638
No!

18:58.722 --> 19:00.682
What do you mean "no"?

19:00.765 --> 19:01.975
Shut up, Maru!

19:02.058 --> 19:03.351
Panicking won't make it work!

19:03.435 --> 19:05.020
Ah, geez!

19:08.732 --> 19:12.986
Everyone, we will be welcoming
your new friends.

19:14.070 --> 19:18.199
This will be a very important
time for you.

19:18.783 --> 19:20.326
Aim for the right future,

19:20.410 --> 19:21.911
no matter what happens.

19:22.537 --> 19:25.415
Listen to your heart if you are confused.

19:25.915 --> 19:28.209
What a vague speech.

19:28.835 --> 19:32.964
Now please say hello to the new 5th years.

19:58.365 --> 20:00.116
<i>That night.</i>

20:01.242 --> 20:03.286
<i>The night I escaped.</i>

20:17.342 --> 20:20.553
Someone broke out!

20:21.137 --> 20:26.685
Someone's escaped!

20:29.229 --> 20:32.023
<i>Someone shouted out immediately.</i>

20:33.149 --> 20:35.944
<i>Was I the traitor for escaping?</i>

20:38.113 --> 20:40.407
<i>Is it a grudge?</i>

20:41.241 --> 20:43.451
<i>I don't even know anymore.</i>

20:44.369 --> 20:46.579
<i>But I do know one thing.</i>

20:47.288 --> 20:49.916
<i>The one who killed Jugo's mother was--</i>

21:06.850 --> 21:08.101
<i>Well,</i>

21:09.185 --> 21:10.353
<i>until next time.</i>

21:21.990 --> 21:23.408
What was that?

21:25.118 --> 21:26.911
What? What? Inside the house?

21:27.495 --> 21:29.289
I got it. I'm coming.

21:37.213 --> 21:39.299
Watch it, you damn idiot!

21:39.883 --> 21:42.385
Hey, isn't that our car?
